@startuml WAH4PCE_Interoperability_Activity_Diagram

skinparam style strictuml
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F8F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #117A65
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50

title WAH4PCE Interoperability - Traceable Activity Diagram

|WAH4PCE Admin|
|WAH (WAH4H/WAH4S/WAH4C)|
|IPaaS (System & ADAPT)|
|External (DOH iHomis)|

' ==========================================
' UC-01: Administer System
' ==========================================
|WAH4PCE Admin|
start
:UC-01 (1): Opens IPaaS login portal\nand enters credentials;
|IPaaS (System & ADAPT)|
if (Valid Credentials?) then (No)
  #FADBD8:UC-01 (Exc 1.1): Invalid Credentials\n(Access denied, logs event);
  stop
else (Yes)
  :UC-01 (1.1): Checks credentials\nand creates access token;
  :UC-01 (1.2): Displays administration dashboard;
endif
|WAH4PCE Admin|
:UC-01 (2): Selects management function\nand enters config changes;
|IPaaS (System & ADAPT)|
:UC-01 (2.1): Saves changes, updates routing state,\nand records in audit trail;
stop

' ==========================================
' CORE DATA PIPELINE (UC-06/07 -> UC-02 -> UC-03 -> UC-04 -> UC-05)
' ==========================================
|External (DOH iHomis)|
start
:UC-06/07 (1): Sends health-data query\nthrough API gateway;
|IPaaS (System & ADAPT)|
:UC-06/07 (1.1): Checks actor's identity,\ntoken, and authorization scope;

' Start UC-02 Provide Health Data
:UC-02 (1.1): Starts core processing pipeline\nand checks incoming API payload;

' Start UC-03 Validate Schema & Completeness
:UC-03 (1.1): Receives payload from core pipeline;
:UC-03 (1.2): Checks payload against registered schema\nand required fields;
if (Validation Fails?) then (Yes)
  #FADBD8:UC-03 (Exc 1.2): Validation Failure\n(Transfer stopped, returns HTTP 400);
  stop
else (No)
endif

' Start UC-04 Translate Data
:UC-04 (1.1): Sends validated payload to\nADAPT transformation service;
:UC-04 (1.2): ADAPT analyzes source format\nand applies mapping rules;

' Start UC-05 Validate Privacy Consent
:UC-04 (1.3): Pauses transformation to\ninclude Validate Privacy Consent;
:UC-05 (1.1): Extracts standard patient identifier;
:UC-05 (1.2): Checks consent registry for sharing rules;
:UC-05 (1.3): Compares rules with current transaction;
if (Consent Denied?) then (Yes)
  #FADBD8:UC-05 (Exc 1.3): Consent Denied\n(Payload purged, returns HTTP 403);
  stop
else (No)
  :UC-05 (1.4): Sends approval token to ADAPT;
endif

' Finish UC-04
:UC-04 (1.4): Completes transformation and returns\nstandardized payload to pipeline;

' Finish UC-03
:UC-03 (1.4): Sends validation-success result\nback to core pipeline;

' Finish UC-02 & UC-06/07
:UC-02 (1.3): Completes the transaction, returns\nappropriate response, finishes routing;

|External (DOH iHomis)|
:UC-06/07 (1.3): Receives formatted HL7/FHIR response;
stop

' ==========================================
' UC-08: Manage Health Data
' ==========================================
|WAH (WAH4H/WAH4S/WAH4C)|
start
:UC-08 (1): Sends HTTP PUT, POST, or PATCH\nrequest to modify existing record;
|IPaaS (System & ADAPT)|
:UC-08 (1.1): Checks actor's write permission;
:UC-08 (1.2): Uses Provide Health Data pipeline\nto process the update;
note right: Follows the same UC-02/03/04/05\ncore pipeline steps shown above
if (Record Locked / Conflict?) then (Yes)
  #FADBD8:UC-08 (Exc 1.3): Record Locked / Conflict\n(Rejects update with HTTP 409);
  stop
else (No)
  #D4EFDF:UC-08 (1.3): Applies update, creates new\nrecord version, returns HTTP 200/204;
endif
|WAH (WAH4H/WAH4S/WAH4C)|
:Record Updated;
stop

@enduml
